axes.tools:
Fetch design context and code, read FigJam/Make content, Code Connect mappings, writing to the canvas
(create/update components and variables — "write to canvas", Professional plan or above);
the complete inventory follows the developer docs.

axes.permissions:
**Plans and seats are hard gates**: the remote server is available on all plans but writing to the canvas needs Professional+ and editing non-draft files needs a Full seat;
the desktop server needs a Dev/Full seat; **only clients in the Figma MCP catalog can connect** (VS Code/Cursor/Claude Code etc.).
Free during beta, moving to usage-based billing later (seen in the directly fetched official help page).
